  "mechanism": "SignalFile::poll, called from Entry::update in the epoll_ctl caller's context, registers the epoll poller only with that thread's (and its process's) signal queues. A thread-directed signal to another waiter thread notifies only that thread's queue, so the epoll entry is never woken.",
  "sites": [
    "kernel/core/src/syscall/signalfd.rs::SignalFile::poll",
