  "contract": "signalfd(2): a thread reading a signalfd receives signals directed to itself, and the descriptor is readable to poll/epoll when such a signal is pending, regardless of which thread registered it.",
  "observed": "When thread A registers the signalfd and a signal is directed at waiter thread B, B's epoll_wait times out twice while B's direct read of the signalfd returns the signal.",
